  I received a notice from Dirkjam DeWit yesterday concerning Augan, a
hardware digital multitrack recording system which is based on Linux.
Actually, Linux "only" acts as the file server, but it's the first time
I've heard of a pro-level audio recording system that uses Linux at all.
Augan is located here:

	http://www.augan.com/

Another interesting development...

